---
layout: base.njk
title: Hackathons by month
description: Browse hackathons by the month they start, from upcoming months back through past events.
---
<h1>Browse by month</h1>
<p class="muted">Events grouped by the month they start.</p>
<ul class="index-grid">
{%- for m in site.months %}
  <li><a href="/month/{{ m.slug }}/">{{ m.name }} <span class="n">{{ m.events.length }}</span></a></li>
{%- endfor %}
</ul>
